```
# Rust target directory
target/

# Cargo registry cache
**/Cargo.lock

# Debug and release builds
**/target/debug/**
**/target/release/**

# Compiled artifacts
*.rlib
*.rmeta
*.so
*.d
*.o

# Incremental compilation data
**/incremental/**

# Build scripts and fingerprints
**/.fingerprint/**
**/CACHEDIR.TAG
**/.rustc_info.json

# Dependencies downloaded by Cargo
**/vendor/**
**/registry/**

# Local database files
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*

# IDE and editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
*.log

# OS-specific files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Coverage reports
coverage/
htmlcov/

# Rust documentation
**/doc/**

# Benchmark results
**/benches/**

# Test binaries
**/test-*

```